      "writtenOn": "2025-12-30T22:16:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey Akilesh, the goal here is to reboot to bootloader without the slot change, as we haven\u0027t flashed the bootloader and can\u0027t be sure what state it\u0027s in.\n\nLike so:\nslot A - adb - apply-update, reboot to bootloader\nslot A (instead of slot B currently) - fastboot - flash bootloader, switch to slot b, reboot bootloader\nslot B - fastboot - flash other static partitions, reboot\nslot B - adb -\u003e snapshot-merge occurs",
      "parentUuid": "e372f59b_6c218e0a",
      "revId": "1b435d929bf416a90fe06106ff1603b1b0cb4a29",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
